---
description: Component rules for the shadcn-based namespace (parity, kit-first, pre-flight)
globs: src/next/**,ds.config.json,PARITY.md,LEGACY-MAP.md
alwaysApply: false
---

The `@ds-ai-ready/...` references assume the package is vendored at `ds-ai-ready/` in the repo root; adjust the prefix otherwise.

Read `ds.config.json` at the repo root first. If `namespace` differs from `src/next`, edit the `globs` line above to match.

Apply every rule in @ds-ai-ready/core/rules.md before writing code under the namespace. When a symptom looks like a component bug, check @ds-ai-ready/core/traps.md before changing the component.

Self-review: before requesting a human review on a component PR, run Bugbot (or a review chat on the diff) and measure each finding in Storybook before fixing it.
